<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Home · Slow Down 4 Sam</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Slow Down 4 Sam — Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Home · Slow Down 4 Sam" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Slow Down 4 Sam — Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs." />
    <%- include('_global_meta'); %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <%- include('_header'); %>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-inner">
          <div class="eyebrow">Michigan nonprofit</div>
          <h1>Ride safe.<br>Slow down.</h1>
          <p class="lead">In honor of Sam Gross. We teach young adults to ride with judgment, and we take care of kids in our communities — gear, licenses, Scouts, and Christmas.</p>
          <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/donate">Donate</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="/history">Sam’s story</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Mission</div><h2>Why we exist</h2>
          <p>To educate young adults about motorcycle safety, encourage responsible riding habits, and foster a culture of awareness on Michigan roads — all in honor of Sam Gross.</p></div>
          <div class="quote">Sam was eighteen. He died on his motorcycle in Petoskey because he was going too fast. We cannot change that. We can make sure the next young rider hears it in time.</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">What we do</div><h2>Five ways we show up</h2></div>
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">01</div><h3>Motorcycle safety classes</h3><p>We teach young adults how to ride with skill, judgment, and respect for the road.</p></article>
            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">02</div><h3>Gear for riders in need</h3><p>Helmets, jackets, gloves, and boots go to people who cannot otherwise afford them.</p></article>
            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">03</div><h3>Youth hunting and fishing licenses</h3><p>We pay for licenses so Michigan kids can get outdoors.</p></article>
            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">04</div><h3>Scouts camp and uniforms</h3><p>We help Boy Scouts and Girl Scouts cover summer camp and uniforms.</p></article>
            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">05</div><h3>Christmas fund for foster care</h3><p>Our Christmas fund gives kids in foster care gifts, warmth, and the feeling of being remembered.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="container grid grid-2">
          <div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Petoskey, Michigan</div><h2>Keep his name pointed at the living.</h2></div>
          <div><p class="quote">“He was only 18 years old. The mistake was speed. The work is making sure it is not someone else’s.”</p><p>Read how Slow Down 4 Sam began, and why we still say his name out loud.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/history">Our history</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container card dark">
          <div class="eyebrow">Help us keep the work moving</div><h2>Give, teach, or put gear in a rider’s hands.</h2>
          <p>Every path goes back to the same request: slow down.</p>
          <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="/donate">Donate</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="/get-involved">Volunteer</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('_footer'); %>
  </body>
</html>